{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12214070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12214070","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1221407001:0":{"text":"なかなか筋がいいですよ！","source_cn":"你的领悟能力还是不错的嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EA6ECE48404DC8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1221407002:0":{"text":"本当？嬉しいなぁ！でも、僕をいじめてる奴らを倒すには、まだまだ弱い……","source_cn":"谢谢老师的夸奖！可要打败那些欺负我的人，我还差得远呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x601720A5F32C70DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1221407003:0":{"text":"上達は早いと思いますよ。でも……あなたは強さ以前の問題だと思います。","source_cn":"其实你学得很快，但我觉得……你的问题并不在于战斗技巧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3234F7FEC2E35AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1221407004:0":{"text":"え……なら、何が問題なの……？","source_cn":"那……那是什么问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C2B6EC5111282E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1221407005:0":{"text":"あなたは避けるのは上手ですが、攻撃の有効打に欠けます。","source_cn":"你很擅长躲避，但有效的攻击却很少。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F88A1090C9ABDD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1221407006:0":{"text":"そうそう、攻撃するとどうしても隙が生まれますからね。初心者はどうしても攻撃じゃなくて防御に走りがちなんです。","source_cn":"嗯，攻击意味着容易出现破绽，新人总是更倾向于保守防御而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E69D76FF7D34370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1221407007:0":{"text":"ぼ、防御というか……僕の場合は、気が弱いからだと思う……子どもの頃から、自分が勝つとこなんて想像したこともないから……","source_cn":"我……不是保守，应该……就是怂，从小就是这样，总觉得自...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CB1142C2CB3B090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1221407008:0":{"text":"先生との練習ならまだしも、本物の敵を前にしたら……たぶん怖くて震えちゃうよ……","source_cn":"和老师对练还好一点，但如果对面是货真价实的对手……我会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5468B3FA2E9676EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1221407009:0":{"text":"そんなのダメですよ！戦いで重要なのは勢いです！もっと自信を持たないと！","source_cn":"这怎么行！作战最重要的就是气势，你要有自信！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A97B5CC3B640BBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1221407010:0":{"text":"でも……自信をつけるなんて、無理だよ……","source_cn":"可是……自信心，这我可学不会……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA429DE9F1053A86E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:122