"variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1221407015:0":{"text":"そりゃあ、あなたは知らないでしょう。薬は私の専売特許だもの！","source_cn":"你当然不知道。要说魔药，还是我更在行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E8ED28DD23FC1FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1221407016:0":{"text":"自信ポーション……それを飲めば、僕みたいなやつでも自信が湧いて、ハムスター先生みたいに勇敢になれるのか？","source_cn":"自信药剂……连我这样的人都可以变得自信吗？只要喝了就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DDBDFDED959C765","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1221407017:0":{"text":"ええ、もちろんです！ロンロン先生よりもさらに勇猛な戦士になれますよ！","source_cn":"当然，我保证，比你的满满老师还要勇猛得多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E4DB48CD0F2313D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1221407018:0":{"text":"本当か！？頼む、その薬をぜひ飲ませてくれ！","source_cn":"真的吗？求你了，请让我试试！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B5D9C934D9CB2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1221407019:0":{"text":"お任せください。では早速薬を調合しますので、埠頭の市場で待っていてください。","source_cn":"嗯，我们现在要去调制药剂，你在码头集市等我们吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A4D1F88A83FB01E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do